三、参考答案

1. ER图（文字描述）

实体：
Student(StuID, Name, Gender, BirthDate, DeptID)
Teacher(TeaID, Name, Title, DeptID)
Course(CourseID, Name, Credit, TeaID)
Department(DeptID, DeptName)
Enrollment(StuID, CourseID, Grade)

关系：
- Student : Department = N : 1
- Teacher : Department = N : 1
- Teacher : Course = 1 : N
- Student : Course = M : N （通过 Enrollment 解决）


⸻

2. 建表SQL语句

CREATE TABLE Department (
    DeptID CHAR(4) PRIMARY KEY,
    DeptName VARCHAR(100) NOT NULL
);

CREATE TABLE Student (
    StuID CHAR(10) PRIMARY KEY,
    Name VARCHAR(50),
    Gender CHAR(1),
    BirthDate DATE,
    DeptID CHAR(4),
    FOREIGN KEY (DeptID) REFERENCES Department(DeptID)
);

CREATE TABLE Teacher (
    TeaID CHAR(10) PRIMARY KEY,
    Name VARCHAR(50),
    Title VARCHAR(20),
    DeptID CHAR(4),
    FOREIGN KEY (DeptID) REFERENCES Department(DeptID)
);

CREATE TABLE Course (
    CourseID CHAR(10) PRIMARY KEY,
    Name VARCHAR(100),
    Credit INT,
    TeaID CHAR(10),
    FOREIGN KEY (TeaID) REFERENCES Teacher(TeaID)
);

CREATE TABLE Enrollment (
    StuID CHAR(10),
    CourseID CHAR(10),
    Grade DECIMAL(4,1),
    PRIMARY KEY (StuID, CourseID),
    FOREIGN KEY (StuID) REFERENCES Student(StuID),
    FOREIGN KEY (CourseID) REFERENCES Course(CourseID)
);


